:: Wolf Fight
<<set _damage to 8>>
<<if $player_class == "Warrior">>
<<set _damage to 5>>
<<elseif $player_class == "Rogue">>
<<set _damage to 7>>
<<elseif $player_class == "Mage">>
<<set _damage to 8>>
<</if>>
<<if $vitality >= 13>>
<<set _damage to Math.round(_damage * 0.8)>>
<</if>>
<<if $has_healing_potion and $hp <= _damage * 2>>
<<set _damage to Math.round(_damage * 0.5)>>
You instinctively reach for your healing potion, but the wolves are too fast. You take the hit but manage to brace yourself, reducing the damage.
<</if>>
<<set $hp -= _damage>>
<<set $quest_wolf_kills += 1>>

# Wolf Fight

You draw your weapon and face the corrupted wolves. They're larger than normal wolves, their eyes glowing with an unnatural green light. The fight is fierce -- you take some hits but bring down one of the beasts.

<<if $player_class == "Warrior">>
Your warrior training holds. You block with your shield, reducing the damage. ''Took <<print _damage>> damage.''
<<elseif $player_class == "Rogue">>
You dodge and weave, but one wolf clips you. ''Took <<print _damage>> damage.''
<<elseif $player_class == "Mage">>
Your staff keeps the wolves at bay, but you're not built for prolonged combat. ''Took <<print _damage>> damage.''
<</if>>

''One wolf killed.'' HP: $hp / $max_hp.
Wolves killed so far: $quest_wolf_kills of 5.

<<if $hp <= 0>>
You've taken too much damage. The world goes dark...

[[...|Defeat]]
<<else>>
<<if $quest_wolf_kills >= 5>>
That was the last one! The forest seems to breathe a sigh of relief. The unnatural green glow in the wolves' eyes fades as they fall.

''5 wolves killed!'' The wolf problem is dealt with.

<<set $forest_cleared to true>>

You should return to Mara and report your success.

[[Return to the entrance|Forest Entrance]]
[[Continue exploring|Forest Path]]
<<else>>
<<if $quest_wolf_kills >= 3>>
You're making good progress. $quest_wolf_kills of 5 wolves killed. But the forest still feels dangerous.
<<else>>
$quest_wolf_kills down, $quest_wolf_kills - 5 to go. The wolves keep coming.
<</if>>

[[Continue fighting|Wolf Fight]]
[[Retreat to the entrance|Forest Entrance]]
<</if>>
<</if>>
